# SHARP Documentation Site

This repository contains the SHARP project documentation website built with
Quarto and published to GitHub Pages via GitHub Actions.

## Local preview

1. Install Quarto: https://quarto.org/docs/get-started/
2. Preview the site:

```
quarto preview
```

## Publish

Publishing is automated. Any push to `main` triggers the GitHub Actions workflow
to build and deploy the site to the `gh-pages` branch.

## Structure

- `_quarto.yml`: site configuration
- `index.qmd`: homepage
- `hermes.qmd`: HERMES experiment page
